# Angel: 96x96 cells. Idle 0-7, flight as walk 30-39, a light cast 50-59; the hover and ascend rows are left unimported (best-effort read).
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet angel.ppm
cell 96 96

bank ANGEL
seq IDLE loop ticks=4 : lin 0-7
seq WALK loop ticks=2 : lin 30-39
seq CAST once ticks=2 : lin 50-59
